WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:04.990
The story of the 1956 film The Conqueror is
among the most shameful in the history of

00:00:04.990 --> 00:00:05.640
Hollywood.

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:10.680
The big-budget would-be blockbuster featured
an epically miscast John Wayne as the 13th

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:12.799
century Mongol warlord Genghis Khan

00:00:12.799 --> 00:00:16.520
It’s not just that Genghis Khan had a southern
drawl, no that’s bad enough.

00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:19.520
The worst part is The Conqueror nearly killed
half its cast.

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:24.580
One of the last films produced by the famously
eccentric businessman Howard Hughes, The Conqueror

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:27.500
was a critical laughing stock and a commercial
failure.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:31.960
In his later years, Hughes reportedly bought
up every print of the film he could find,

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:35.600
and obsessively watched it nearly every evening
in his private screening room.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:36.200
Why?

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:40.520
Some speculate it was out of guilt over the
decision to film The Conqueror in a nuclear

00:00:40.520 --> 00:00:41.400
fallout zone.

00:00:41.620 --> 00:00:42.660
Yes, it's true.

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:47.620
The Conqueror was filmed on location outside
the dusty, sleepy town of St. George, Utah,

00:00:47.620 --> 00:00:52.150
which lay about 100 miles downwind of the
U.S. Government's nuclear test zone.

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:57.620
In 1953 alone, the government ran 11 nuclear
tests there, assuring the residents of St.

00:00:57.620 --> 00:01:00.260
George that there was no danger from the radiation.

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:01.200
They were wrong.

00:01:01.300 --> 00:01:07.260
Between 1954, when The Conqueror filmed in
St. George, and 1981, no fewer than 91 of

00:01:07.260 --> 00:01:11.600
the production's 220 cast and crew contracted
some type of cancer.

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:16.240
And that number doesn't include incidents
of cancer among family members who also spent

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:17.400
the summer on the set.

00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:22.060
At the time, it was thought the location was
safe, so even Wayne himself brought his sons

00:01:22.060 --> 00:01:26.000
Patrick and Michael for an extended visit
both later developed cancer.

00:01:26.120 --> 00:01:30.420
At one point, a Geiger counter was brought
to the set, but it gave off so much noise

00:01:30.420 --> 00:01:32.200
that Wayne assumed it was malfunctioning.

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:35.800
But it wasn't, and the cast and crew soon
began to suffer the effects.

00:01:35.800 --> 00:01:42.060
Wayne's co-star, Pedro Armendariz, developed
kidney cancer in 1960, and took his own life

00:01:42.070 --> 00:01:45.310
in 1963 after being given a terminal diagnosis.

00:01:45.310 --> 00:01:49.130
That same year, director Dick Powell succumbed
to cancerous lymphoma.

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:53.670
Another of Wayne's co-stars, veteran stage
and screen actress and four-time Academy Award

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:59.680
nominee Agnes Moorhead, passed away from uterine
cancer in 1972, and Kahn’s love interest

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:04.200
Susan Hayward died of pneumonia brought on
from complications due to brain cancer in

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:05.260
1975.

00:02:05.580 --> 00:02:09.500
As for Wayne, he received a diagnosis of lung
cancer in 1964.

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:14.160
After having one of his lungs and four ribs
removed, he was declared cancer free, and

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:18.840
went on to star in several more classic films,
including The Green Berets and True Grit.

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:24.600
His final role, in the 1976 Western The Shootist,
was an eerie harbinger of things to come;

00:02:24.610 --> 00:02:29.350
he portrayed an aging gunfighter who engages
in one last campaign for frontier justice

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:32.740
after being told that his painful death from
cancer is imminent.

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:38.540
During a routine gallbladder removal in 1979,
surgeons found a malignant tumor which forced

00:02:38.540 --> 00:02:41.580
them to remove the Duke's stomach; Wayne died
six months later.

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:46.720
All told, 46 people who worked on The Conqueror
died from cancer or related illnesses.

00:02:46.860 --> 00:02:47.860
And they aren't alone.

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:52.660
A subsequent study concluded that as many
as 11,000 Americans a figure which some believe

00:02:52.670 --> 00:02:57.420
to be ridiculously conservative lost their
lives as a result of Cold War-era nuclear

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:57.920
testing.

00:02:57.940 --> 00:03:03.120
Since 1990, a fund established by Congress
has paid out $2 billion dollars to residents

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:07.380
of the very fallout area where The Conqueror
was filmed, an area which includes St. George,

00:03:07.380 --> 00:03:09.760
in which cancer rates remain abnormally high.

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:15.160
In 2015, St. George resident and activist
Michelle Thomas a cancer survivor whose mother

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:17.110
died from the disease told The Guardian,

00:03:17.110 --> 00:03:18.760
"It's gone into our DNA.

00:03:18.760 --> 00:03:20.890
I've lost count of the friends I've buried.

00:03:20.890 --> 00:03:22.010
I'm not patriotic.

00:03:22.010 --> 00:03:23.200
My government lied to me.

00:03:23.360 --> 00:03:25.880
[...] You have to forgive me if I don't give
a shit about John Wayne.

00:03:25.880 --> 00:03:27.290
They rewrote my DNA.

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:28.360
They rewrote my life."

00:03:28.590 --> 00:03:32.640
By all accounts, Hughes considered his choice
of location for The Conqueror's shoot to be

00:03:32.640 --> 00:03:34.060
the worst mistake of his life.

00:03:34.290 --> 00:03:38.460
To his credit, though, it should be noted
that before selecting St. George as the location,

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:42.080
he was worried about the possibility of radiation
danger from the testing.

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:45.000
So he asked the government's Atomic Energy
Commission for advice.

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:45.780
Their answer?

00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:48.100
They told him it would be perfectly safe.

